{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English localization for the game is planned. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your support means a lot to us; please consider adding it to your wishlist.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/9245590eb2d91fee3f59c5942ba4b5fc.avif?t=1770888745\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You unexpectedly find yourself transported into the world of <i>Water Margin</i>. As the fated 109th hero, you are thrust into the treacherous currents brewing before the great gathering at Mount Liang. Here, loyalties are tested, alliances shift, and every choice you make ripples through the lives of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/08fc30c12c8ff8b925395206e1d2ef59.avif?t=1770888745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras_big/08fc30c12c8ff8b925395206e1d2ef59.webp?t=1770888745 width=1560 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/b8d1edd3a81f07da173e63acad126943.avif?t=1770888745\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key decisions in the game will determine which heroes you ally with, which storylines you enter, and ultimately shape your stance within the Liangshan factions and the game\u2019s ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/e60c86d10a79dc44bf4fccc48b68fbce.avif?t=1770888745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras_big/e60c86d10a79dc44bf4fccc48b68fbce.webp?t=1770888745 width=1560 height=1428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/95ee9dcd5fe9db29f46844ac4e144348.avif?t=1770888745\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore a world composed of an over-world map and regional maps. By passing attribute checks, they can trigger interactions, take on side quests, and encounter random events. Exploring key areas will advance the main plot and unlock different story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/0d5416871c5a1d98b5dcdfed04cc3246.avif?t=1770888745\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/d3790cde554cc395c2370b6ec63df062.avif?t=1770888745\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can participate in the stories of different Liangshan heroes, such as Lin Chong, Wu Song, Lu Zhishen, and others. By befriending them and meeting certain conditions, players can  form a team with these heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/084ebde3e2cb394685abb78466666ea2.avif?t=1770888745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the fate of <i>Water Margin</i>\u2019s legendary outlaws</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching narratives \u2014 each playthrough tells a new story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win over heroes and spare them from their tragic ends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the factions, rivalries, and schemes within Mount Liang</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn visuals inspired by traditional Chinese woodblock prints</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914030?t=1770888745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914030?t=1770888745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/ceddc7428def467a20e784057d435976ce94594e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770888745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/ceddc7428def467a20e784057d435976ce94594e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770888745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4000000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English localization for the game is planned. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your support means a lot to us; please consider adding it to your wishlist.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/9245590eb2d91fee3f59c5942ba4b5fc.avif?t=1770888745\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p cl